  <p id="c-nanshi-053-dinglingguang-sons:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">武帝八男。<persName id="c-nanshi-053-dinglingguang-sons:p001:m0005" ref="2zn_kvj_dmy_A">丁貴嬪</persName>生昭明太子<persName id="c-nanshi-053-dinglingguang-sons:p001:m0013" ref="0va_s3x_wb4">統</persName>、簡文皇帝、廬陵威王<persName id="c-nanshi-053-dinglingguang-sons:p001:m0024" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_G">續</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-053-dinglingguang-sons:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">廬陵威王<persName id="c-nanshi-053-dinglingguang-sons:p002:m0004" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_G">續</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-053-dinglingguang-sons:p002:m0006" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_G">世欣</persName>，武帝第五子也。</p>
</text>
